    {
      "id": "vav_temp_sensor_temp_99779260",
      "name": "检测温度恒定",
      "原因分析": "1、温控器参数设置问题\n2、温控器/温度传感器问题",
      "专家处理建议": "1、检查温控器温度参数设定。\n2、改变温控器/温度传感器环境的温度看数值是否有变化。\n3、拆开温控器/传感器盖板，检查内部电路是否有腐蚀、烧坏等现象\n4、如果以上都正常，则判断为温控器/温度传感器故障，建议更换",
      "meta": {
        "deviceType": "VAV",
        "component": "温控器/温度传感器",
        "points": [
          "zoneTemperature",
          "ahuSupplyFanStatus",
          "boxOccupancyModeSetpoint"
        ]
      },
      "window": {
        "type": "rolling",
        "durationSeconds": 3600
      },
      "trigger": {
        "rule_engine": "(((zoneTemperature == prev(zoneTemperature)) and (ahuSupplyFanStatus == 1)) and (boxOccupancyModeSetpoint == 1))"
      },
      "effective": {
        "metric": "ratio_true",
        "threshold": 1.0,
        "minSamples": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "vav_temp_sensor_temp_sensor_over_range_f2e6d088",
